tl-iop-digital-analogue-io-surge-protector/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/4qgdbooy/mtl-iop-1.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fc2e6beac60\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL IOP digital &amp; analogue I/O surge protector</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">MTL IOP: ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t kinh t&#x1EBF; cho I/O s&#x1ED1; v&#xE0; t&#x1B0;&#x1A1;ng t&#x1EF1;, m&#x1EA1;ch lai 20 kA, si&#xEA;u h&#x1EB9;p 6 mm/v&#xF2;ng, &#x111;&#x1EA7;u n&#x1ED1;i th&#xE1;o r&#x1EDD;i, ch&#x1EE9;ng nh&#x1EAD;n Ex ia, Ex n.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["chong-set-tiep-dia"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/chong-set-lan-truyen/chong-set-fieldbus-eaton-mtl-fp32-fs32-tp32/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/3dijgude/mtl-fp32.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd6143457ac03c\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t lan truy&#x1EC1;n cho Fieldbus Eaton MTL FP32, FS32, TP32</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t cho trunk v&#xE0; spur m&#x1EA1;ng fieldbus: FP32 l&#x1EAF;p DIN rail, FS32 c&#x1EAF;m tr&#xEA;n Megablock v&#xE0; fieldbus barrier, TP32 l&#x1EAF;p t&#x1EA1;i transmitter.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["an-toan-vung-nguy-hiem", "chong-set-tiep-dia"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/chong-set-lan-truyen/bo-chong-set-tin-hieu-eaton-mtl-sd16r/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/snbnnq3q/mtl-sd16r-1.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fc2e7a91cf2\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">B&#x1ED9; ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t t&#xED;n hi&#x1EC7;u Eaton MTL SD16R</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Eaton MTL SD16R: module ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t d&#x1EEF; li&#x1EC7;u 7 mm cho RS232/RS485 v&#xE0; v&#xF2;ng 2 d&#xE2;y, b&#x103;ng th&#xF4;ng 50 MHz, ch&#x1ECB;u xung 20 kA, ATEX/IECEx.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["chong-set-tiep-dia"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/chong-set-lan-truyen/thiet-bi-kiem-tra-chong-set-du-lieu-eaton-mldt28500/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/3qpo5pmc/sdm-range-617x400.jpg?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fbbc9da8039\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Thi&#x1EBF;t B&#x1ECB; Ki&#x1EC3;m Tra Ch&#x1ED1;ng S&#xE9;t D&#x1EEF; Li&#x1EC7;u Eaton MLDT28500</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">MLDT28500: m&#xE1;y ki&#x1EC3;m tra di &#x111;&#x1ED9;ng cho thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t t&#xED;n hi&#x1EC7;u &#x2013; th&#x1EED; li&#xEA;n t&#x1EE5;c v&#xE0; d&#xF2;ng r&#xF2; &#x1EDF; 7/16/32/55 V, k&#x1EBF;t qu&#x1EA3; Pass/Fail b&#x1EB1;ng LED.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["chong-set-tiep-dia"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/chong-set-lan-truyen/thiet-bi-chong-set-weidmuller/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/qxphprxi/vtl_weidmuller_suge_protection.jpg?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fbbc