ch</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">LYTECH&#x2019;s Retractable Bypass Conductor (RBC)</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">LYTECH RBC: d&#xE2;y d&#x1EAB;n s&#xE9;t co r&#xFA;t t&#x1EA1;o li&#xEA;n k&#x1EBF;t &#x111;i&#x1EC7;n tr&#x1EF1;c ti&#x1EBF;p, ki&#x1EC3;m tra &#x111;&#x1B0;&#x1EE3;c b&#x1EB1;ng m&#x1EAF;t gi&#x1EEF;a th&#xE0;nh b&#x1ED3;n v&#xE0; m&#xE1;i n&#x1ED5;i &#x2013; gi&#x1EA3;m nguy c&#x1A1; ch&#xE1;y vi&#x1EC1;n m&#xE1;i do s&#xE9;t.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["lytech"], "giaiphap": ["chong-set-tiep-dia"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/chong-set-lan-truyen/chong-set-nguon-eaton-mtl-slp/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/hamixolk/mtlslp-1.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fc1659a8d0d\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t ngu&#x1ED3;n Eaton MTL SLP</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; ch&#x1ED1;ng s&#xE9;t lan truy&#x1EC1;n cho &#x111;&#x1B0;&#x1EDD;ng ngu&#x1ED3;n c&#x1EA5;p thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; &#x111;i&#x1EC1;u khi&#x1EC3;n, &#x111;o l&#x1B0;&#x1EDD;ng &#x2013; l&#x1EAF;p DIN rail trong t&#x1EE7;, b&#x1EA3;o v&#x1EC7; PLC, DCS, b&#x1ED9; ngu&#x1ED3;n v&#xE0; thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; tr&#x1B0;&#x1EDD;ng.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"], "giaiphap": ["chong-set-tiep-dia"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/chong-set-lan-truyen/bo-loc-nguon-chong-set-eaton-mtl-ma15/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/wq5dfazj/mtl-ma15.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd614345d10c84\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class